Scoped avgblur video filter

The option table, pixel-format list, radius resolution and clipping, plane
geometry and box-blur kernel in src/video-ops/avgblur.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_avgblur.c (avgblur_options, pix_fmts, config_input, build_lut,
averageiir2d, the FILTER macro instantiated as filter_lut8 and filter_slow8
with LUT_DIV and SLOW_DIV, filter_frame with av_image_copy_plane for
unselected planes).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
